al","role":"Security Guard #5"},{"id":2727174,"name":"Toni Cayuela","role":"Soldier","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9t3cKnDml8gE1RIZxtaoD7ojBoQ.jpg"},{"id":2727177,"name":"Alberte Montes","role":"Taxi Driver","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oJaFNvXI5SOZJlJwF2Qma7JaV3q.jpg"},{"id":111090,"name":"Javier Botet","role":"Medeiros Girl (uncredited)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuVbt1oreUUPPR0MhKKL7y6i9Dt.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"[•REC]⁴ - Apocalypse","overview":"Angela Vidal, una giovane reporter televisiva entrata in una palazzina con i vigili del fuoco per testimoniare la distruzione del virus, riesce ad uscirne viva, ma quello che i militari non sanno è che in lei si annida il seme dell’infezione. La donna viene portata in un impianto di quarantena provvisorio ad alta sicurezza, dove dovrà rimanere in isolamento per diversi giorni.","tagline":"È giunta l'ora"},{"language":"en-US","title":"[REC]⁴ Apocalypse","overview":"Ángela Vidal, the young television reporter who entered the building with the firemen, manages to make it out alive. But what the soldiers don't know is that she carries the seed of the strange infection. She is to be taken to a provisional quarantine facility, a high-security installation where she will have to stay in isolation for several days. An old oil tanker, miles off shore and surrounded by water on all sides, has been especially equipped for the quarantine.","tagline":"It’s time to leave."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Aunque el virus ya ha salido del edificio en cuarentena en el tercer filme, ahora con [REC]⁴ volverá la acción al final de la segunda parte dentro del edificio, desvelando el origen y el futuro de esta sangrienta y macabra epidemia. Con Manuela Velasco empezó y con ella terminará la historia de gore, zombies y tensión. La actriz volverá a ser la protagonista del final de la franquicia. El desenlace de la pandemia que convierte a las personas en cuerpos salvajes y hambrientos volverá al terror más puro y salvaje de las primeras, al mismo tiempo dará respuestas a las incógnitas que rodean una de las carnicerías más conocidas del cine español.  Las calles de Barcelona no se llenarán de infectados, pero se descubrirá un nuevo y terrorífico lugar donde los infectados atacarán y devorarán a cualquier superviviente que pueda quedar de este apocalípsis.","tagline":"Bienvenidos a bordo"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dODQuE1jnDP30OYvHPFSYkAzsPU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wKQpAxTL5MOpkb9Mk6w4vabtSe7.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":185341,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dODQuE1jnDP30OYvHPFSYkAzsPU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dODQuE1jnDP30OYvHPFSYkAzsPU.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dODQuE1jnDP30OYvHPFSYkAzsPU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dODQuE1jnDP30OYvHPFSYkAzsPU.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1VA1ducZcHvcOIrz1X5wK7v3REY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1VA1ducZcHvcOIrz1X5wK7v3REY.jpg","language":"it","width":853,"height":1280}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vbflx4rDj3YrRAAk4HSWsEgZVlK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vbflx4rDj3YrRAAk4HSWsEgZVlK.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vbflx4rDj3YrRAAk4HSWsEgZVlK.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vbflx4rDj3YrRAAk4HSW